1️⃣ What is Database per Service?

👉 Each microservice owns its own database
👉 No other service can directly access it

❌ Monolith Style (Wrong in Microservices)
All services → One Shared DB

Problems:

Tight coupling ❌

Breaking changes everywhere ❌

Scaling issues ❌

✅ Microservice Style
Auth Service        → auth_db
Account Service     → account_db
Transaction Service → transaction_db
Notification Service → notification_db

👉 Each service = independent + isolated

